@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REEMPLAZAR_POR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@categoriaId = 1
@areaId = 1
@ticketId = 1
@tecnicoId = 1

### Login; copiar accessToken en @token. Usar el rol adecuado en cada operación.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin.prueba","password":"NuevaClave123"}

### Listar categorías (autenticado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoría (administrador): 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Redes"}

### Consultar categoría por ID: 200 o 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias/{{categoriaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar (administrador): 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias/{{categoriaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Conectividad"}

### Eliminar una categoría sin referencias (administrador): 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias/{{categoriaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validación: 400 con details.name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalogos/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":""}

### Crear ticket (usar token del solicitante y una categoría existente): 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Sin acceso a red","description":"No puedo acceder al sistema","categoryId":{{categoriaId}},"areaId":{{areaId}},"impact":"ALTO","urgency":"ALTO"}

### Asignar (coordinador)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/asignacion
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"technicianId":{{tecnicoId}}}

### Atender (técnico asignado)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state":"EN_ATENCION"}

### Historial (usuario autorizado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets?estado=EN_ATENCION&areaId={{areaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
